  "description": "Beta: A production standard for AlgFormer/HoloFormer models: an append-only lineage journal that answers \"what was true at this point in training\" without ever re-deriving it from current state, a confidence-gated decode policy (resonance-floor or nucleus sampling, with a degeneracy guard), and a growth surface that grows a model's context, layers, shifts, or vocabulary correctly by construction while stamping the journal automatically. For teams running AlgFormer/HoloFormer models in production who want checkpoint lineage and decode behaviour to stay correct through every growth step, not re-derived from whatever is live at the time.",
